      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER FINE (8) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (26.29) last time out at Temora. Strike rate this course strong having won two of four tries. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Makes plenty of appeal. CAWBOURNE ELSIE (3) finished third (23.30) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Should play a prominent role. HUMBLE LOMAR (2) boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 1.75 lengths (19.01) behind Dynamic Jenalli at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. GRAPEFRUIT YAEKO (6) can find the frame without surprising.",
